<title>USA: Arkansas Development Authority repriced, ylds cut.</title>
<headline>Arkansas Development Authority repriced, ylds cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Arkansas Development Finance Authority's $74 million bond deal, lowering the 2017 A-1 maturity five basis points to 5.50 percent.</p>
